AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0008283> "This term was moved out from being a child of 'cellular process' because it is a cell population-level process, and cellular processes are restricted to those processes that involve individual cells. Also note that this term is intended to be used for the proliferation of cells within a multicellular organism, not for the expansion of a population of single-celled organisms.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0008283> "cell population proliferation")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0008283> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0009987>)

