AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:22240591") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:22652539") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28330855") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:2882172") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28901328") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0019786> "Catalysis of the reaction: [protein]-C-terminal L-amino acid-glycyl-phosphatidylethanolamide + H2O = [protein]-C-terminal L-amino acid-glycine + a 1,2-diacyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphoethanolamine. An example of this reaction is the removal of ATG8 from membranes to which it is covalently linked to a phosphatidylethanolamid via its terminal glycine residue.")
