AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:ecd") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:15661519") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:7840137") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0032421> "A bundle of cross-linked stereocilia, arranged around a kinocilium on the apical surface of a sensory hair cell (e.g. a neuromast, auditory or vestibular hair cell). Stereocilium bundles act as mechanosensory organelles by responding to fluid motion or fluid pressure changes.")
