AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0050904> "Note that the term diapedesis, although sometimes used as a direct synonym for cellular extravasation, is used here for the specific final step of the process, in concordance with recent reviews of the topic.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0050904> "diapedesis")
