AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0072539> "GO:0072539")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0072539> "Note that immunologists typically use the word 'development' to refer to cells of B or T cell lineages undergoing the process that GO describes as 'cell differentiation'.")
